fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"mpegtsdemux/MpegTSBase.html#MpegTSBase:skew-corrections","fragment":"\n\tskew-corrections\n\nWith push TIME inputs, apply continuous skew corrections to the output. The\ndefault is enabled. You can disable it if downstream doesn't require live\nsynchronization.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\ttrue\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});